  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Autumn Components"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A Nuxt 3 application showcasing reusable page 'block' components with a live editor. Blocks are registered dynamically from `app/components/blocks`, configured via YAML forms, previewed with fixtures, and styled via a token-driven design system (Style Dictionary + CSS variables). Includes a storybook-like viewer at `/blocks` with device preview, form-driven props, and live-editable design tokens persisted in localStorage."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Built with [Nuxt 3](https://nuxt.com/docs/getting-started/introduction) and [Nuxt UI](https://ui.nuxt.com/)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Setup"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Make sure to install the dependencies:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```bash"
        }
      ]
    },
